run became its own column: in a narrow pane the battery model's row
and the optimizer's current-hour row (longer since both meters are
shown) wrapped into a ragged grid and overflowed the card. Inside a
flow stage the rows are now plain block text and wrap as sentences.

Co-Authored-By: AI
EOF
